  request is now stendigcalendars.com, so the old host conditionals
  always resolved the same way: every xx-only class hidden except
  .uk-only and .eu-uk-only (whose conditions excluded the primary
  domain). This static block is byte-for-byte that outcome, minus
  seventeen dead conditionals. The mechanism cannot vary by market any
  more — if region-gated content is ever needed again, key it on
  routes.root_url, not the host.
{% endcomment %}
        <style>
          .eu-only, .fr-only, .dk-only, .nl-only, .de-only, .it-only,
